# {{.AppName}}

{{if .Minimal}}`fxkit.Minimal()` + Huma.{{else}}`fxkit.Default()` + Huma.{{end}}

Located at `{{.ServiceDir}}` (import path `{{.ImportPath}}`).

## Run

From the **repo root**:

```bash
{{- if .DefaultLayout}}
make run SVC={{.AppName}}
# or
{{- end}}
go run ./{{.ServiceDir}}/cmd serve --config {{.ServiceDir}}/configs/config.yaml
```

- `GET /greet/{name}` — sample Huma handler
- `GET /docs` — Scalar API reference
- `GET /healthz` — liveness

Dump OpenAPI (no HTTP listen) and generate a typed Go client:

```bash
{{- if .DefaultLayout}}
make openapi SVC={{.AppName}}
{{- end}}
fxkit gen client --spec {{.ServiceDir}}/openapi.yaml --out ./internal/clients/{{.AppName}}
```
